  <p>
    This website is operated by: <strong>Moritz Kröger</strong>, Berlin, Germany. Email: <a href="mailto:write@morkro.de">write@morkro.de</a>
  </p>

  <h2>1. Hosting</h2>
  <p>This website is hosted by <a href="https://statichost.eu" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>statichost.eu</strong></a>, operated by Variable Object Assignment, Stockholm, Sweden.</p>
  <p>When you visit this website, your IP address is necessarily processed temporarily in order to deliver the website to your device. According to statichost.eu, IP addresses and other personal visitor data are not logged or stored.</p>
  <p>The legal basis for this processing is Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR. My legitimate interest is providing this website securely and reliably.</p>  
  
  <h2>2. Analytics</h2>
  <p>
    I use <a href="https://wireboard.io" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>WireBoard Analytics</strong></a>, provided by SwissOps Ltd., Sur la Croix 147, 1020 Renens, Switzerland, to understand how this website is used and to improve its content and performance. 
    WireBoard is configured in <strong>cookieless mode</strong>.
  </p>
  <p>It does not use analytics cookies, local storage, persistent visitor identifiers or device fingerprints, and does not recognise visitors across different page views.</p>
  <p>The information processed includes:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>the page visited and timestamp</li>
    <li>referrer information</li>
    <li>browser type and screen size</li>
    <li>time spent on the page</li>
    <li>page-load performance information</li>
    <li>approximate geographic location</li>
  </ul>
  <p>As with any HTTP request, the visitor's IP address is transmitted when connecting to WireBoard's infrastructure. WireBoard states that the IP address is used only to determine approximate geographic information and is anonymised at the point of collection. The full IP address is not retained for analytics purposes.</p>
  <p>WireBoard processes this data on my behalf. Temporary visitor data is removed after the visit, while aggregated statistics may be retained for up to three years.</p>
  <p>The legal basis for this processing is Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR. My legitimate interest is understanding the use and performance of this website without creating persistent visitor profiles or using advertising trackers.</p>
  <p>No automated decision-making or profiling takes place.</p>
